Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 19:02:16 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] US-10.1: one iterator walks everything takeable in a room

- RoomContentsIterator walks floor then chest; remove() deletes from the right list
- Room.contents() and asContents()
- TakeCommand: takeFromFloor/takeFromChest replaced by one loop using it.remove()
- GameWorld.totalLoot counts the floor too (fixes an unreported bug)
- CommandParser loot targets come from one walk
- IteratorCompositeTest (US-10.1 section)

